+
+> Best AI tools for lawyers 2026 should be transparent, inspectable, and easy to self-host around sensitive client data. This GitHub-only awesome list focuses on open source repositories lawyers, legal ops teams, compliance teams, and legal engineers can actually review, fork, and run without depending on proprietary SaaS lock-in.
+
+## Table of Contents
+- [TL;DR](#tldr)
+- [Why This List](#why-this-list)
+- [Open Source Tools](#open-source-tools)
+- [FAQ](#faq)
+- [Contributing](#contributing)
