+#### [Presidio](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio)
+> **Description:** Microsoft Presidio is one of the strongest open source frameworks for detecting and anonymizing PII and sensitive text. That matters directly for lawyers handling discovery, internal investigations, HR matters, healthcare records, and any workflow that requires redaction before outside sharing. Presidio is library-first rather than product-first, which gives legal engineering teams flexibility to embed it inside document review pipelines, web tools, or batch processors. It can identify entities, support custom recognizers, and automate masking or replacement strategies. For firms that need privacy controls around AI ingestion, Presidio is often the safest starting point because it is mature, auditable, and widely used.
