+
+## Formatting
+
+Use the existing README structure:
+
+- Add new tools under the most relevant category
+- Keep each tool entry in the same `#### Tool Name` format
+- Include all metadata bullets
+- Add `---` between entries
+
+If a category has fewer than five strong repositories, note the gap honestly instead of padding the list with weak fits.
